* {{la-IPA}}
* {{audio|la-cls-optimus.ogg|Audio (Classical)|lang=la}}

===Adjective===
{{la-adj-superlative|optimus|bonus}}

# [[best]]; very good
#: ''Hic mundus perfectissimus est etiam mundorum possibilium omnium optimus''
#:* This most perfect world is even the best of all possible worlds ({{w|Immanuel Kant}}, echoing {{w|Leibniz}}).

